{
  "_README": [
    "RECEIPT-COVERAGE LEDGER. Every mutation classified in _shared/action-risk.ts must appear here",
    "with its receipt posture declared. Risk classification already fails closed and is CI-enforced;",
    "evidence coverage did not, so a lane could add a write tool, forget the receipt, and nothing",
    "would say so. This ledger is the gate that says so.",
    "",
    "receipt values:",
    "  emits              - this capability writes a capability receipt. `evidence` names where.",
    "  exempt             - deliberately writes none. `reason` must say why, and must be a real",
    "                       architectural reason (e.g. the outbound record has one home elsewhere),",
    "                       not 'not done yet'.",
    "  seeded_undeclared  - FROZEN DEBT, seeded 2027-04-11. Nobody has decided yet. A NEW tool may",
    "                       NOT use this value; the lint rejects it. It exists only so the gate",
    "                       could be installed without 147 guesses about existing behaviour.",
    "",
    "Honest scope: `emits` here is asserted only for the nine tools named in the three declarative",
    "*_WRITE_CAPABILITIES sets, which are exact. It is NOT a claim that the other 147 emit nothing —",
    "several demonstrably do (missions, campaign briefs, calendar presets, social, orchestration).",
    "Their posture was simply never written down, and a detector that guessed would be wrong often",
    "enough to get this guard switched off. Converting seeded_undeclared -> emits/exempt is ordinary",
    "work for whoever owns each capability."
  ],
